30110","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch Community Play DYST","summary":"Watch Community Play DYST","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:29:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038168","verified_at":"2026-10-24T01:25:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4830110-1846018067940259","game_id":"steam-4830110","kind":"announcement","title":"🔥 BOBBY HUNT MODE IS NOW IN THE DEMO!","summary":"🔥Bobby Hunt has been Added to the Demo!You asked for it. We heard you. And now… there are consequences of failing too many times.Thank you all so much for the incredible support and feedback around DYST. ❤️ As a small indie team, seeing so many of you eager to try our game means more to us than you know.We originally planned to save the Bobby Hunt Mode mechanic for the full release, but after seeing how many of you wanted to experience it early, we decided to bring a part of it to the demo. And ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:59:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4830110-1844751498225679","game_id":"steam-4830110","kind":"announcement","title":"🎪 20,000+ WISHLISTS, TICKETS HAVE BEEN BOOKED.","summary":"🎪 20,000+ TICKETS ARE BOOKED 🎟️🎟️20,000 of you are coming to the carnival.You saw something. Your friend didn’t. And somehow… 20,000 of you decided to look closer.We honestly can't thank you enough. ❤️Every Wishlist, every comment, every share, every friend you've convinced to step into the carnival with you. it all means the world to us. For an indie team making this game, seeing 20,000 people waiting to play our game is something we never take for granted.Did You See That? launches on Steam De","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T18:55:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225679","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4830110-1844115010488432","game_id":"steam-4830110","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — Invites & Bug Fixes","summary":"Hey everyone! Thanks for pointing out bugs and sharing your feedback! Your reports have helped us track down issues and improve the game. Here’s what’s changed in this update: Added Added an “Invite Friend” option. Fixed Fixed an issue that caused the cutscene to freeze. Fixed a door interaction issue caused by lag. Fixed the door being unresponsive when interacting from certain angles. Fixed an issue that allowed players to pause during the cutscene. Thanks again for helping us make the demo be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T08:17:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488432","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4830110-1844115010487701","game_id":"steam-4830110","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for Playing — Bobby Hunt Mode Is Coming to the Demo!","summary":"Thank You for Playing — Bobby Hunt Mode Is Coming to the Demo! Hey everyone, Thank you so much for trying out the DYST demo. The response has honestly been overwhelming, and we really appreciate everyone who’s played, shared the game with friends, or taken the time to leave feedback. We originally planned to keep the Bobby Hunt Mode mechanic for the full game, but so many of you have asked for it that we’ve decided to add it to the demo too. You can expect it in the coming few days! It means a l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T23:19:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487701","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4830110-1843481262699000","game_id":"steam-4830110","kind":"announcement","title":"1,100 Players Have Tried the Demo — Thank You!","summary":"Hey everyone! We've reached 1,100 total players in the Did You See That? demo so far! Thank you to everyone who gave it a try, brought a friend along, and shared their experience. Your feedback, bug reports, and suggestions have been a huge help. They've helped us spot issues and understand where the game needed clearer explanations. Sorry for the confusion and bugs some of you ran into, and thanks for giving us the chance to improve things! What's Changed Since the Demo Launched We've made the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T08:15:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699000","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4830110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4830110":"2026-10-26T04:27:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4830110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5164600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4830110","app_id":4830110,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:00Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"